                                                    <p class="font-semibold text-2xl sm:text-[2.5rem] sm:leading-10 font-author mb-5">Polylang is our go-to plugin for creating multilingual websites</p>
                                                                            <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl sm:pr-14">All multilingual sites we produce have been using Polylang for years, and it works like a charm. Whether it&#8217;s for multinationals with multilingual multisite networks or simple bilingual showcase websites, Polylang meets the needs of both our customers and our developers. It&#8217;s objectively the best solution on the market, and I think we&#8217;ve got plenty of time before we get such performant features in phase 4 of Project Gutenberg… mark my word from a WordPress Core Committer! 😀</p>
