                                                                            <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl sm:pr-14">As a web-development agency, we use Polylang for implementing multilingual WordPress websites. This allows us to design seamless and efficient websites that meet our clients&#8217; needs. The user-friendliness and flexibility of Polylang have significantly streamlined our development processes, enabling us to consistently deliver
